    {
      "id": "claim_95d778176be54a56854ba6dfecb595b2",
      "statement": "The TraceLinkType enum assigns each runner family a Redis key prefix and endpoint name (SAD_CODE=ardocodeResult, SAM_CODE=arcotlResult, SAD_SAM=swattrResult, SAD_SAM_CODE=transarcResult, plus OTHER), and request IDs are built as traceLinkType.getKeyPrefix() + ':' + projectName + hash, so the prefix doubles as the Redis key namespace.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/api_response/TraceLinkType.java#L9-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f667cff4f73cd1f9a3dee71d3584210c38769a9e12684aa5b3b7b82791f6e161:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/controller/AbstractController.java#L131-L135",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:78d9b6a73f688485eab23b162556e28436c234b264e7f4ee0808bc3f74dd5f80:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_87907672f0c54522a5f8e43d7585c1bd",
      "statement": "Request IDs are derived only from input file content: HashGenerator.getMD5HashFromFiles concatenates all input files' bytes (FileConverter.convertFilesToByte) and passes them to UUID.nameUUIDFromBytes, producing an ID that is independent of the optional additionalConfigs JSON, so identical inputs with different configurations map to the same cached result.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/controller/AbstractController.java#L144-L157",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1526a661711a6da944c92f3401bc080d26d0c6882bda22a9697ce8a8e7496936:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/converter/FileConverter.java#L34-L49",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1acd981accfae3dd52fdff8903b42f2c92a27886f545eac8102fb295e0af9111:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/util/HashGenerator.java#L27-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bc7cedeb69c49b34a753558863fb4f0965d296a7814ca264bddb9a2674efbfc3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6617093b7afc48429566d4cb5a11a5b5",
      "statement": "AbstractRunnerTLRService.runPipeline starts a new pipeline only when the result is neither in the database (DatabaseAccessor.keyExistsInDatabase) nor tracked as in-flight (CurrentlyRunningRequestsRepository.containsRequest); otherwise it returns the cached result or an empty Optional, and new runs are launched via CompletableFuture.supplyAsync and registered in the singleton CurrentlyRunningRequestsRepository ConcurrentHashMap.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/repository/CurrentlyRunningRequestsRepository.java#L17-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a2ed8604858d6ec52825bcdaa68d855b74b7433964dc5e0ac85e017eb5b17017:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/service/AbstractRunnerTLRService.java#L83-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5e8428ca1e5f1259866bc20abc8cfbf6a42fec3c0ee5cba8a6c9b5589b744a11:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e6f89e0a4d084d1e80f8df42bf63ad23",
      "statement": "The asynchronous pipeline run executes runner.run(), converts the result to JSON, and stores it in Redis; on any exception it stores an 'Error: '-prefixed payload under the request ID and rethrows ArdocoException, while a finally block always removes the request from the in-flight registry and deletes the temporary input files.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/service/AbstractRunnerTLRService.java#L102-L126",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:44663f46d4490d4d47e0a1684038f70084ec073f6b4f0d47534a4d3b380fd4a5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ee8426fdfb18491997388d79c82c8786",
      "statement": "Redis is the durable result store: RedisAccessor is the @Primary DatabaseAccessor implementation that saves results with a TTL taken from the redis.time-to-live.hours property (24 in application.properties), so cached results expire after 24 hours; the DatabaseAccessor interface exists so the persistence backend can be swapped.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/repository/DatabaseAccessor.java#L8-L17",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6b91b5ac05902cae4629dec772ff509d62d99baffbde5efe37f4fc2a1ff7bb9e:"
        },
        {
