    {
      "id": "claim_ec6188115e154d079528ab76399a8847",
      "statement": "Controllers are responsible for setting up the ArDoCo runner themselves: each start endpoint converts multipart uploads to temporary files, parses additionalConfigs, generates the request ID, constructs and configures the concrete runner (e.g. Ardocode with CodeConfiguration and a temporary output directory), and only then delegates to the service layer.",
      "evidence": [
